# V3 apps/v2-ui — V2's UI copied in 2026-08-10. The rules above predate this
# directory, so its build output was being tracked: 187 files / ~35 MB of
# webpack cache turned up in an unpushed commit.
DebateAI-V3/apps/**/node_modules/
DebateAI-V3/apps/**/.next/
DebateAI-V3/apps/**/.next-dev*/
DebateAI-V3/apps/**/.next-build*/

# Acceptance harness runtime state. `.pgdata` is a LIVE PostgreSQL data
# directory and `.pgdata-backup-*` are local recovery copies taken before a
# register reseed (DR-151). Both are machine-local runtime state, never source:
# one backup put 1615 files / ~34 MB into an unpushed commit.
DebateAI-V3/acceptance/.pgdata/
DebateAI-V3/acceptance/.pgdata-backup-*/
